+| Claim | Input | Formal claimed result | Candidate Python | Canonical Python |
+|---|---|---|---:|---:|
+| universal (`len=4 >= 3`) | `[1,2,3,4]` | `floatVal(7,2)` | `3.5` | `2.5` |
+| odd example | `[3,1,2,4,5]` | `intVal(3)` | `3` | `3` |
