+kompile .../semantic.k --main-module MEDIAN-SEMANTICS
+  --syntax-module MEDIAN-SYNTAX --backend llvm
+  --output-definition .../build/concrete-kompiled
+```
+
+Exit was 0. LLVM emitted a relevant warning:
